      "created_at": "2013-02-04T11:07:23.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I'm really not sure.&nbsp; I'm tempted to say it is an invalid play since the first sentence can't be followed, but if it is valid I would definately say it goes on top because that is before the instruction to put one on the bottom.</p><p>(Although I guess I can think of an alternate reading where you select the same card twice and put it on the top, then on the bottom, but that seems kind of silly).</p>",
