      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mcbehrer/{size}/1850_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-02-05T17:54:52.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>There are no such invalid plays, since in Sentinels the clauses on a card are not conditional. Unless it specifically says \"if you do...\" on them, you can play a card even if you can't fulfil all the effects. In this case, you would pick prison break and a second, invisible card, and pick one to put on top and one on bottom.</p>",
