      "username": "j1hopki1",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/58f4c7/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2013-02-05T18:23:58.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The rules say that if you can't do something on a card that's okay,&nbsp;just do what you can. For example, if Traffic Pileup is in play heroes cannot draw. Haka can still legally play Haka of Battle. He would not draw two cards, but he can still discard one or more cards and he still get the damage boost for each discard.</p>",
      "post_number": 4,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:26:49.819Z",
