      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mcbehrer/{size}/1850_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-02-06T05:54:35.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>4 is correct. It doesn't say \"put one on top. Put one on bottom.\" It just says \"and,\" (and not and THEN, either) which means that they happen simultaneously in an undetermined order. Since the rules state that any simultaneous actions occur in an order as decided by the players, you could either put it on top or on bottom according to your whim.</p>",
